Third-party runtime dependencies

This plugin is built against resty.limit.conn (part of lua-resty-limit-traffic,
Copyright (C) Yichun Zhang (agentzh)), which ships as part of the OpenResty
distribution that Kong itself runs on. No source from that project is
copied or redistributed in this repository -- it is used at runtime only,
as already provided by the target Kong installation.
